import{_ as e,o as n,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 465 | Dragon Ball · Civilizational-Weight Analysis: Goku's Personal Weight Crushes Civilizational Consensus","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 465 | Dragon Ball · Civilizational-Weight Analysis: Goku's Personal Weight Crushes Civilizational Consensus","no":465,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Civilizational Weight","Goku","Personal Weight","Civilizational Consensus"],"related":["29-Symbiotic-Degree Assessment System","49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0465_模块2-龙珠-文明权重分析-悟空个人权重碾压文明共识.md","filePath":"en/0465_模块2-龙珠-文明权重分析-悟空个人权重碾压文明共识.md"}`),t={name:"en/0465_模块2-龙珠-文明权重分析-悟空个人权重碾压文明共识.md"};function s(r,i,l,c,d,h){return n(),o("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-465-dragon-ball-·-civilizational-weight-analysis-goku-s-personal-weight-crushes-civilizational-consensus" tabindex="-1">Entry 465 | Dragon Ball · Civilizational-Weight Analysis: Goku&#39;s Personal Weight Crushes Civilizational Consensus <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-465-dragon-ball-·-civilizational-weight-analysis-goku-s-personal-weight-crushes-civilizational-consensus" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 465 | Dragon Ball · Civilizational-Weight Analysis: Goku&#39;s Personal Weight Crushes Civilizational Consensus&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 34 · Civilization Analysis 7) | Benchmark base: Documents 29, 49, 26</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-one-person-s-will-equals-the-whole-civilization-s-will" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when one person&#39;s will equals the whole civilization&#39;s will <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-one-person-s-will-equals-the-whole-civilization-s-will" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when one person&#39;s will equals the whole civilization&#39;s will&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou uses &quot;civilizational weight&quot; to measure an individual&#39;s decision-making share in civilization: in a mature civilization, any individual&#39;s weight should not exceed 5%, because civilizational consensus should be co-built by Myriad Ranks. Dragon Ball world&#39;s civilizational weight distribution is extreme: Goku alone&#39;s weight occupies over 90% of Earth civilization&#39;s decisions — whether to fight Frieza, whether to join Tournament of Power, whether to befriend Zeno, all decided by him alone. This entry takes the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> as core, analyzing Dragon Ball world&#39;s civilizational-weight imbalance.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational-weight imbalance&#39;s energy waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Decision cost concentrated</strong>: Goku alone decides &quot;whether to fight Frieza,&quot; &quot;whether to join Tournament of Power&quot;; Myriad Ranks do not participate in decision-making</li><li><strong>Decision risk concentrated</strong>: Tournament of Power&#39;s wager is 8 universes&#39; survival; Goku alone decides; Myriad Ranks bear consequences</li><li><strong>Decision unaccountable</strong>: Goku decides wrong (e.g., Tournament of Power almost destroys the universe), no one holds him accountable, no one vetoes</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How civilizational-weight imbalance feeds historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Myriad Ranks no participation sense</strong>: because decisions all by Goku alone, Myriad Ranks have no &quot;this is our civilization&quot; subject sense</li><li><strong>Decision no error-correction mechanism</strong>: Goku decides wrong; Myriad Ranks cannot veto; can only bear</li><li><strong>Civilizational consensus nonexistent</strong>: Dragon Ball world never formed &quot;Myriad-Ranks consensus&quot;; everything relies on Goku&#39;s one-person will</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s role in civilizational-weight imbalance:</p><ul><li><strong>Accepting personal weight too high</strong>: Goku never feels &quot;me alone deciding the whole universe&#39;s survival has a problem&quot;; he defaults &quot;I am strongest, I decide&quot;</li><li><strong>Treating Myriad Ranks as chips</strong>: Tournament of Power he alone proposes, 8 universes&#39; survival becomes a wager — this is personal domination of Myriad Ranks&#39; fate</li><li><strong>Not cultivating decision-making mechanisms</strong>: Goku never established &quot;Myriad-Ranks council&quot; decision mechanism; he leaves after fighting, never reviews</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Civilizational-Weight Imbalance</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Goku personal weight &gt; 90%</td><td>Anchor Council legislation: any individual&#39;s weight not exceeding 5%</td></tr><tr><td>Decision cost concentrated</td><td>Separation of powers: legislative/executive/judicial mutually check</td></tr><tr><td>Decision no error correction</td><td>Symbiotic Court judicial independence: major decisions go vote; have veto mechanism</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad Ranks no participation sense</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build: Myriad Ranks have subject sense</td></tr><tr><td>Tournament of Power personal decision</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: Myriad Ranks&#39; fate must not be gambled by any individual</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball world&#39;s civilizational-weight distribution</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Goku&#39;s weight drops to 5%, decisions go Anchor Council vote&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count Myriad-Ranks participation rate, decision error-correction rate, civilizational consensus maturity</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Dragon Ball Civilizational-Weight Imbalance Report</em>, quantifying &quot;Goku&#39;s personal weight too high&quot;&#39;s loss to civilization</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Civilizational-weight self-consistency: low</strong> (Goku alone decides everything; Myriad Ranks no decision mechanism)</li><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks republican self-consistency expected: high</strong> (individual weight constrained; Myriad Ranks co-build)</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong> (decisions all by Goku; plot follows his will)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong> — civilizational weight entirely tied to Goku; no institutional backup</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: decision cost concentrated on Goku alone; Myriad Ranks&#39; wisdom wasted</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Myriad Ranks&#39; fate dominated by Goku personally; Tournament of Power wager is typical</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least built an academy for universal benefit; Goku did not even build a decision mechanism</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks no decision participation; only &quot;protected&quot; objects</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a cosmos with imbalanced civilizational weight cannot truly move toward Myriad-Ranks co-governance</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s personal weight crushing civilizational consensus is Dragon Ball world&#39;s deepest structural disease. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: any individual, even strong enough to sit at Zeno&#39;s table, weight should not exceed 5%; any decision, even concerning the universe&#39;s survival, must go through Myriad-Ranks parliament vote. Let Goku from &quot;the sole decision-maker&quot; become &quot;a member of the Anchor Council&quot;; Dragon Ball world then truly has civilizational consensus.</p><p>One more layer: Goku&#39;s personal weight too high&#39;s most extreme case is Tournament of Power. He alone proposes, alone decides to attend, alone decides the wager — 8 universes&#39; survival became his chip for &quot;wanting to trade blows with the strong.&quot; Zeno agreed because he also thinks &quot;it&#39;s fun.&quot; This means Dragon Ball world&#39;s most major decision was made by two entities who think &quot;it&#39;s fun&quot;; billion-billion beings&#39; fate in this game is not even as good as a card. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Anchor Council precisely prevents this: any decision involving Myriad Ranks&#39; survival must go through Myriad-Ranks representatives&#39; vote; any individual — even Goku, even Zeno — has no right to decide alone.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · civilizational-weight analysis · Goku&#39;s personal weight crushes civilizational consensus described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./464_模块2-龙珠-平民处境-普通人在战力世界的无助.html">Entry 464 · Commoners&#39; Situation</a> · <a href="./466_模块2-龙珠-因果自律缺失-龙珠许愿与因果扰乱.html">Entry 466 · Causal Self-Discipline Absence</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">29-Symbiotic-Degree Assessment System</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=e(t,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
